OL,3,GNEWSALifts reopen after multi-storey
OL,4,Acar park upgrades
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo new lifts have opened at a
OL,7,Fmulti-storey car park in Loughborough.
OL,9,F"Outdated" lifts in the Beehive Lane
OL,10,Fcar park have been out of action while
OL,11,Fthey were replaced as part of a
OL,12,F#750,000 investment by Charnwood
OL,13,FBorough Council, which owns and
OL,14,Foperates the site.
OL,16,FAs part of the work which began in
OL,17,FJune, the top floor of the car park has
OL,18,Falso been resurfaced.
OL,20,FWork to retile the stairways is also
OL,21,Fdue to take place, said the council.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
